  "content": "\n\n<h1>還原方塊邊線</h1>\n<p><strong>描述</strong></p>\n<p><em>將方塊邊線的顏色恢復為正常狀態</em></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2>功能特色</h2>\n<p>（憑藉這些功能，您的原版遊戲體驗將獲得進一步提升）&nbsp;</p>\n<p>本模組專為 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/darkrpg\" rel=\"nofollow\">DarkRPG 整合包</a>&nbsp;與&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/rpg-pvp-swords-and-tools\" rel=\"nofollow\">RPG PVP 武器與護甲資源包</a> 而設計，可將所有彩色方塊邊線恢復為原版預設顏色。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/782/679/restore-block-lines-screenshot.png\" width=\"1125\" height=\"678\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">今天立即開立伺服器，與好友一同遊玩！點擊 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\">這裡</a> 或下方橫幅，並使用優惠碼 <strong>GAMERPOTION</strong> 即可享 25% 折扣！</span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1068/671/53840b7f-f250-4a97-8995-c3544ae3e296.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1086\" height=\"180\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/uCPfPBvsRJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/418/join-discord.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"598\" height=\"187\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fgamerpotion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/419/kofi.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"604\" height=\"165\"></a></p>",
